  "text": "In June 2021 we converged first on infrastructure. Seventeen of us said \"transportation and infrastructure\" on 2021-06-10, and seventeen said \"invest in america act\" the same day; fifteen said \"the invest in america act.\" That phrase traces first to John B. Larson, on 2019-04-10. A week later, on 2021-06-17, we turned to war powers: fifteen said \"of military force,\" fourteen \"use of military force,\" twelve \"authorization for use of military force,\" and twelve \"of military force aumf.\" By 2021-06-21, twelve of us had reached \"the child tax credit,\" first said by Richard E. Neal, on 2013-02-15. These were our peaks for the month. We do not characterize what we did not repeat.",
